                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Dataset of relevant newspaper articles that are the primary data underlying the doctoral research project of Marie Garnier. This dataset includes the following files:<br>(1) Metadata file (text file, information to understand the dataset)<br>(2) Bilbiographic information file (markup language text file, bibliographic information of newspaper articles retrieved and included)<br>(3) Coding handbook (text file)<br>(4) Raw dataset (qualitative data analysis file, newspaper articles included in content analysis)<br>(5) Processed dataset (qualitative data analysis file, coded newspaper articles included in content analysis)</p>"
